# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Simulation output.
#
# results/ is regenerated by main.py, and every file records the parameters and
# seeds that produced it, so the runs are reproducible from the code alone --
# there is no reason to version thousands of JSON files. Keep the directory
# itself so main.py does not have to create it on a fresh clone.
results/*
experiments/*
!results/.gitkeep

# The exploratory scripts in experiments/ ARE tracked: they are the record of
# what was tried and why, and experiments/README.md summarises their findings.
# Their raw *_out.txt output is tracked too, since several of those numbers are
# quoted in the README and cannot be regenerated without re-running for hours.

# Scratch
*.tmp
*.bak
_*.json
scratch/
